# Telephony glue. The STT / TTS / VAD / turn-classifier / language-identifier
# engines all come from the audio package — with the [localmodels] extra
# (transformers for Smart Turn; onnxruntime, which runs Silero VAD, Smart Turn
# and the identifier, is in the core) since the phone pipeline runs them
# locally. `uv pip compile`
# pins the transitive deps below. Compile + install run from the repo root so
# `./audio` resolves (dev `oto-dock/`, Docker `/app`, bare-metal `/opt/otodock`).
-e ./audio[localmodels]
